# Listing Feedbacks

### Create feedback (authenticated)
POST {{host}}/feedbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great place, very clean.",
  "statusAfter": "APPROVED"
}

### List feedbacks for a listing (public)
GET {{host}}/feedbacks/listing/{{listingId}}

### Get feedback by id
GET {{host}}/feedbacks/1

### Delete feedback (owner or admin)
DELETE {{host}}/feedbacks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


